          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "എമിഗ്രേഷൻ — emigrēṣan — \"passport control\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "എമിഗ്രേഷനിൽ അവർ എന്റെ പാസ്പോർട്ടും വിസയും പരിശോധിച്ചു. emigrēṣanil avar enṟe pāspōrṭṭuṁ visayuṁ pariśōdhiccu. At immigration they checked my passport and visa."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "At an airport, Malayalam speakers usually call the passport desk എമിഗ്രേഷൻ (emigrēṣan), the English name of the check on people leaving."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "എമിഗ്രേഷൻ (emigrēṣan) was borrowed from English emigration, the passport check for people leaving a country."
            }
          ]
        },
