          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പരിശോധന (pariśōdhana) is borrowed from Sanskrit pariśodhana, \"cleaning, purification\" (Monier-Williams). In Malayalam it means a close check or an inspection."
            }
